                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d7b0322-b49f-4a39-935f-a1b800291a40",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0ea2ac-5dd0-3c5e-91f1-dafd88dfca81",
                                                "text": "Super Nintendo, Sega Genesis / When I was dead broke, man, I couldn't picture this / 50-inch screen, money-green leather sofa / Got two rides, a limousine with a chauffeur / Phone bill about two G's flat / No need to worry, my accountant handles that / And my whole crew is loungin' / Celebratin' every day, no more public housin'"
